        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Write now: it is a breaking change without considerable benefit.\r\n\r\nInitially:\r\n- Explicit is better than implicit.\r\n- It is consistent with how `MiniSessions.delete()` works in this case (no argument and no current session).\r\n- I don't like local sessions for some reason.\r\n\r\nClosing this then.",
